hi

REQUIREMENTS:
- Ideally <5 seconds send time between users
- Can support up to 4 ppl

voice activity detection: Silero VAD

speach separator: Multi-Decoder DPRNN or SepTDA (stretch goal, not in MVP, use turn-taking instead)

speach recognition (speaker mermory): NVIDIA Streaming Sortformer (Good) + voice embeddings, with voice check-in and manual one-tap reassignment

speach to text: Whisper + fast-Whisper (faster-whisper, int8 quantized, also does language detection)

text to speech: Azure AI API (TTS) (on click only, proxied through backend, cached, watch F0 free tier limits)

translation: Azure AI Translator (finalized utterances only, one request for all target languages)

Backend: Python + FastAPI

Frontend: TypeScript/React/Vite + Tailwind CSS

Real-time transport: WebSockets (audio chunks + live chat events) + REST (/tts)

Demo fallback: Text input box (type messages if mic or venue noise fails)

Install:
run npm install (first time only), then npm run dev in fontend/.


